Artifinance
===========

Artifinance is a fork of Sure (https://github.com/we-promise/sure), based on Sure v0.7.5-hotfix.3.
Sure is itself a community fork of Maybe Finance (https://github.com/maybe-finance/maybe).

Artifinance is not affiliated with or endorsed by Maybe Finance Inc. or by the Sure project.

