What Artifinance changes
- Name, logo, favicon, app icons and PWA manifest (Artifinance branding).
- Forecast and Velocity pages, linked in the sidebar.
- Rent split: a shared rent payment counts at your share, with your roommate's Venmo recorded as a transfer.
- Plaid: only the products each item already uses are requested; deleting a bank in the app doesn't
  remove the Plaid item (it is shared with another local app).
- Scripts used by the local `money` command (artifinance/runner), available in the image at /money.
